## 4. Event catalog

| Event key | Trigger (code path) | v1 | Payload gợi ý |
|---|---|:---:|---|
| `mention` | `append_mentions` return > 0 | ✅ | from, targets, item, dept, snippet |
| `inbox_distributed` | `append_inbox_distributed` | ⏳ v2 | source, destination, file count, actor |
| `schedule_due` | timer / mở Schedule page | ⏳ v2 | milestone/allocation, due date |
| `schedule_saved` | `write_project_schedule_to_disk` | ❌ | Quá noisy |
| `publish` | (chưa có hook thống nhất) | ❌ v3 | asset/shot, version, dept |

### 4.1 `mention` (v1)

Sau khi `append_mentions` thành công trong `ItemNotesDialog._dispatch_mentions_for_new_entries`:

```python
dispatch_discord_event(
    workspace_root,
    project_root,
    event="mention",
    payload={
        "from_user_id": from_uid,
        "from_name": from_name,
        "to_user_ids": [i.to_user_id for i in new_items],
        "item_rel": rel,
        "item_display": display,
        "department": dept,
        "snippet": snip,
        "project_name": project_display_name,
        "mention_ids": [i.id for i in new_items],
    },
)
```

- Gửi **một message** gom nhiều target trong cùng note (không 1 POST/user).
- Optional: map `to_user_ids` → Discord `<@id>` nếu roster có field `discord_user_id` (v2).

