## 5. Discord message format

Dùng [Discord Execute Webhook](https://discord.com/developers/docs/resources/webhook#execute-webhook) — `POST {webhook.url}?wait=false`

### 5.1 Embed mẫu (@mention)

```json
{
  "username": "MONOS",
  "allowed_mentions": { "parse": [] },
  "embeds": [{
    "title": "Tachi mentioned you",
    "description": "char_hero_aya · Model\n> Can you check the UVs on the cape?",
    "color": 5814783,
    "fields": [
      { "name": "Project", "value": "ProjectAlpha", "inline": true },
      { "name": "Department", "value": "Model", "inline": true }
    ],
    "footer": { "text": "MONOS Pipeline" },
    "timestamp": "2026-06-07T12:00:00.000Z"
  }]
}
```

- `color`: hex user `color_hex` từ roster (fallback `#3b82f6` → decimal).
- **Không** deep link MONOS (desktop app) v1 — chỉ text path/display name (mono trong field nếu cần).
- `allowed_mentions.parse: []` mặc định; bật `@everyone`/`roles` **không** cho phép từ app.

### 5.2 Plain fallback

Nếu embed build lỗi → `content` một dòng: `Tachi mentioned @you in char_hero_aya (Model)`.

