## 7. UI — Settings → Project → Integrations

Thay placeholder trong `_build_project_page` bằng tab thật (hoặc tab con Discord trong Integrations).

### 7.1 Layout

```
[ Card: Discord ]
  Enable Discord notifications          [ toggle ]
  Webhook URL                           [ password-style QLineEdit ]
  Channel label (optional)              [ QLineEdit ]
  ── Events ──
  ☑ @mentions in notes
  ☐ Inbox distributed        (disabled / coming v2)
  ☐ Schedule due reminders   (disabled / coming v2)
  [ Send test message ]  [ Save ]
  Hint: Webhook URL is stored in workspace .monostudio/integrations.json (synced).
```

- **Send test**: POST embed "Test from MONOS on {machine} / {user}"; success/error `QMessageBox`.
- Webhook URL: show masked khi đã lưu; nút "Replace" để paste URL mới.
- Chỉ user có quyền admin pipeline (hoặc `access_control` dev) được sửa — reuse pattern settings nhạy cảm nếu có.

### 7.2 Local vs shared

- Config lưu **workspace** `integrations.json` (sync).
- Toggle "Disable on this machine only" (optional v2): `QSettings` key `discord/disabled_locally` — không ghi file shared.

