## 10. Thứ tự triển khai

### Phase 1 — Foundation (v1.0)

1. `integrations.json` schema + `load_integrations` / `atomic_write`.
2. `discord_webhook.py`: build embed + POST urllib.
3. Background queue + rate limit + dedupe.
4. Wire `mention` tại `append_mentions` success path (1 call site).
5. Settings UI: enable, URL, mention toggle, test, save.
6. Manual test với Discord test channel.

### Phase 2 — More events (v1.1)

7. `inbox_distributed` hook tại `append_inbox_distributed`.
8. `schedule_due`: daily check khi app mở + optional `QTimer` 1x/ngày; chỉ milestone quá hạn / due today.
9. Project-level override file (nếu cần).

### Phase 3 — Polish (v1.2)

10. Roster `discord_user_id` + ping.
11. Per-machine opt-out.
12. Outbox file `workspace_root/.monostudio/discord_outbox.json` retry khi offline (optional).

